{
    "title": "Cat Boba Tea: ASMR Live Master",
    "description": "Immerse yourself in the whimsical world of Cat Boba Tea: ASMR Live Master, an addictive, story-driven simulation game! \ud83c\udfae\ud83d\ude3a Enter a space of relaxation and delight where you become a charming feline indulging in a delicious boba tea feast. Experience the joy of roleplaying mukbang as you step into the paws of our purr-fect star while crafting and sipping boba tea.\r\n\r\nDIVE INTO THE ROLE OF THE CAT \ud83d\udc3e\r\nStep into the paws of our purr-fect star of the show. In the simulation game Cat Boba Tea: ASMR Live Master, you play as a cat doll and experience the life of an ASMR eating live master. Each bite and sip become an event as you take on the exciting life of an ASMR mukbang star. Savor the flavor while the world watches your live stream \ud83c\udfa5\ud83d\udc31\r\n\r\nCREATE & SAVOUR BOBA TEA \ud83c\udf75\r\nBubble Tea Simulator  - Unleash your creativity in an exciting DIY boba tea crafting simulation. Mix, shake, and prepare your boba tea then bask in the delightful slurps that are truly a feast for the ears. Lose yourself in soothing sounds that unravel pure tranquility.\r\n\r\nDRESS UP TO IMPRESS \ud83d\udc57\r\nSpice up your live sessions by customizing your feline friend with tons of adorable outfits. Fashion up and impress your viewers with your stylish threads.\r\n\r\nBRACE FOR CUTENESS OVERLOAD \ud83d\ude3b\r\nIndulge in a super cute, healing visual style that oozes cuteness at every turn. Combined with unique ASMR features, this relaxing simulation game offers ultimate relaxation and stress relief.\r\n\r\nExperience endless joy and tranquility with Cat Boba Tea: ASMR Live Master. Unveil your inner cat in bubble tea simulator, create milk tea drinks, and embrace the adorableness. Download and become the ultimate Boba Tea Master! \ud83c\udfae\u2615\ud83d\udc31",
    "descriptionHTML": "Immerse yourself in the whimsical world of Cat Boba Tea: ASMR Live Master, an addictive, story-driven simulation game! \ud83c\udfae\ud83d\ude3a Enter a space of relaxation and delight where you become a charming feline indulging in a delicious boba tea feast. Experience the joy of roleplaying mukbang as you step into the paws of our purr-fect star while crafting and sipping boba tea.<br><br>DIVE INTO THE ROLE OF THE CAT \ud83d\udc3e<br>Step into the paws of our purr-fect star of the show. In the simulation game Cat Boba Tea: ASMR Live Master, you play as a cat doll and experience the life of an ASMR eating live master. Each bite and sip become an event as you take on the exciting life of an ASMR mukbang star. Savor the flavor while the world watches your live stream \ud83c\udfa5\ud83d\udc31<br><br>CREATE &amp; SAVOUR BOBA TEA \ud83c\udf75<br>Bubble Tea Simulator  - Unleash your creativity in an exciting DIY boba tea crafting simulation. Mix, shake, and prepare your boba tea then bask in the delightful slurps that are truly a feast for the ears. Lose yourself in soothing sounds that unravel pure tranquility.<br><br>DRESS UP TO IMPRESS \ud83d\udc57<br>Spice up your live sessions by customizing your feline friend with tons of adorable outfits. Fashion up and impress your viewers with your stylish threads.<br><br>BRACE FOR CUTENESS OVERLOAD \ud83d\ude3b<br>Indulge in a super cute, healing visual style that oozes cuteness at every turn. Combined with unique ASMR features, this relaxing simulation game offers ultimate relaxation and stress relief.<br><br>Experience endless joy and tranquility with Cat Boba Tea: ASMR Live Master. Unveil your inner cat in bubble tea simulator, create milk tea drinks, and embrace the adorableness. Download and become the ultimate Boba Tea Master! \ud83c\udfae\u2615\ud83d\udc31",
